# ===============================================================
# Deliberately NOT ignored 
# ===============================================================
# Migrations/            → EF migrations are source code. Program.cs runs
#                          MigrateAsync() on startup, so the database cannot
#                          be created without them.
# package-lock.json      → locks exact frontend dependency versions.
# *.sln / *.slnx / *.csproj → the project files themselves.
